sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Visitor
  participant F as Waitlist form
  participant R as API route
  participant B as Netlify Blobs
  participant N as Netlify Forms
  participant W as Webhook
  V->>F: types email and optional role
  F->>F: regex check reveals optional fields
  F->>R: POST JSON email role caringFor company
  R->>R: lowercase, length check, honeypot check
  R->>B: setJSON key at plus email
  B-->>R: stored via blobs
  R->>N: POST form-name waitlist to __forms.html
  R->>W: POST JSON with 4 second timeout
  N-->>R: 200 ok
  N->>N: submission_created emails owner
  R-->>F: ok true via blobs
  F-->>V: You are on the list
